<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Forestry - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Forestry - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		346.14		vs	  303.01</p>
<p> Operating	    6.51		vs	    5.21</p>
<p> Current		7.74		vs	    6.94</p>
<p> Net		    4.33		vs	    3.92</p>
<p> EPS		   24.53 yen	  vs	   22.21 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    176 million	  vs	 176 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Forestry Co Ltd is a lumber trader and importer.</p>
